------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Adapted code
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

skylineqr-core adapts parts of Every QR Code
(https://github.com/AlbertAZ1992/every-qrcode): link parsing and identity
scopes (core/Link.kt, from packages/core/src/url.ts), its test cases
(LinkTest.kt, from url.test.ts) and the generator-version scheme
(core/GeneratorVersion.kt), and its QR role map (core/QrRoles.kt, from
packages/core/src/qr-roles.ts). skylineqr-compose adapts its morph's reversal timing,
a duration scaled by the distance left (render/Morph.kt, from
packages/renderer-webgpu/src/renderer.ts).
