QR encoder (skylineqr-core/.../core/QrMatrix.kt)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

QrEncoder adapts ZXing's QR encoder (https://github.com/zxing/zxing,
core/src/main/java/com/google/zxing/qrcode/encoder: Encoder, MatrixUtil and
MaskUtil, version 3.5.3) into plain Kotlin, cut down to error correction M and
symbol versions 1 to 6, so the browser can draw the same code (2026-11-21).
Modified from the original: rewritten in Kotlin, with only the modes, levels
and versions SkylineQR uses. ZXing is Copyright 2007-2024 ZXing authors and
distributed under the Apache License 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

