Maths (skylineqr-core/.../core/FdLibm.kt)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FdLibm adapts sin, cos, tan, atan, atan2, hypot and pow from fdlibm 5.3
(https://www.netlib.org/fdlibm/), the library behind java.lang.StrictMath,
into Kotlin, so the planner's maths gives the same bits in the browser as on
the phone. fdlibm is distributed under this notice:

